{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056150/extras/c9eee3aff9a10df60e98906e64f0859f.poster.avif?t=1759197030\" width=631 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056150/extras/c9eee3aff9a10df60e98906e64f0859f.webm?t=1759197030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike platformer, you play as the sandmouse to descend into a maze-like dungeon. Test your map-sense and mark your way through each level to find the optimal paths! The full game has 4 levels, in the demo you win by getting to the 2nd level and retrieving the key back to the lobby shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you'll need to loot the dungeon and find your way back to the shop before night falls. There, you can purchase various upgrades to push further on the following days within the same run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056150/extras/f2534c7f723638d87138bd3ffd34cc22.poster.avif?t=1759197030\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056150/extras/f2534c7f723638d87138bd3ffd34cc22.apng?t=1759197030\" class=\"bb_img\" width=631 height=172 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides enemies and traps, you'll have to race against time. Plan your route and rush through the dungeon to make it out before time's up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive procedurally-generated levels. Demo content has Mini and Default level sizes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place torches to mark the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, challenging gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge modifiers for adjusting game difficulty and level size. Demo has 1 modifier: lock max HP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-run shop with upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-day runs\u20144 tries to beat each dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night sequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, 10\u201315 minute runs (roughly 1/3 the length of a full-game run)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056150?t=1759197030","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056150?t=1759197030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056150/56871e78cb937a77fba4e481c6b9ad3fb320a169/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759197030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056150/56871e78cb937a77fba4e481c6b9ad3fb320a169/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759197030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056150/extras/c9eee3aff9a10df60e98906e64f0859f.poster.avif?t=1759197030\" width=631 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst